flowchart TD
    A[Read images from data/raw/label] --> B[Open image with Pillow]
    B --> C{Image readable?}
    C -- No --> D[Reject corrupted image]
    C -- Yes --> E{Width and height >= 128?}
    E -- No --> F[Reject too-small image]
    E -- Yes --> G[Convert to RGB]
    G --> H[Save as JPEG with standard name]
    H --> I[Compute perceptual hash]
    I --> J[Compare hash with previous images in same label]
    J --> K{Hamming distance <= threshold}
    K -- Yes --> L[Move duplicate sample to data/duplicates]
    K -- No --> M[Keep image in data/cleaned]
    M --> N[Manual review grid]
    N --> O{Wrong label or poor quality?}
    O -- Yes --> P[Move to data/rejected]
    O -- No --> Q[Keep final cleaned sample]

